-- הסכם קיבוצי — השתתפות עובדים בנטל וצמצום הוצאות השכר (16.6.2009): the
-- public-sector framework agreement, between the State, the public
-- employers and the Histadrut, that halves the havraa (recreation) pay of
-- 2009 and 2010 for the employees it covers, the reduction never larger than
-- the State's own employees'. Whom it covers (§2), its period (§3), the
-- reduction and its several paths — the annual payment, a workplace that had
-- already paid 2009's, a separate monthly component, pay that includes it —
-- with retirement and death, budgetary pensions, provident funds and
-- severance (§4); the radiographers' five added days (§5); entry into force
-- on the havraa statute's enactment (§6); earlier agreements (§7); and the
-- follow-up committee (§8).
--
-- It speaks to no pay item of the shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4):
-- it covers the employees whose scales the Histadrut represents, and no
-- teacher instrument in the root speaks of havraa pay, so it is not one of
-- the agreements' root's instruments. The 7.6.2010 agreement amends it
-- (l4/agreements/framework/2010-06-07_framework-agreement_public-sector_havraa-reduction-deferral.l4).
--
-- The statute §6 waits on — חוק לתשלום חלקי של דמי הבראה בשירות הציבורי
-- בשנים 2009 ו-2010 (הוראת שעה), התשס"ט-2009 — is outside the corpus by
-- design (its standing decision 14); the State's own reduction, which caps
-- this one, is set there, and is an input here.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT budget_foundations_law

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — השתתפות עובדים בנטל וצמצום הוצאות השכר (16.6.2009)`

