§§ `1 מבוא והוראות כלליות`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the preamble is part of the 2009 havraa agreement` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולה`

-- §2(ב) names four kinds of public employer by other laws: a budgeted body
-- and a health corporation (Budget Foundations Law §21), a supported body
-- (§32), and an education institution of the Compulsory Education Law that
-- the government funds. Sections 21 and 32 are encoded
-- (l4/laws/budget-foundations-law.l4); a health corporation, which that
-- encoding takes as an input, and the Compulsory Education Law, outside the
-- corpus, are facts of the case.
@desc An employee and employer, as far as the havraa agreement of 16.6.2009 asks.
DECLARE `havraa agreement employee` HAS
    `employed by an employer that signed the 2009 havraa agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `paid by agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents` IS A BOOLEAN @desc משכורתו מחושבת לפי הסכמים קיבוציים החלים לגבי אחד הדירוגים המיוצגים על-ידי ההסתדרות
    `the employing body` IS AN `employing body` @desc as the Budget Foundations Law's §§21 and 32 tell bodies apart
    `employed by a health corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc "תאגיד בריאות" in §21's sense
    `employed by a funded education institution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc "מוסד חינוך" of the Compulsory Education Law §1 whose budget the government shares, directly or not
    `the employer joined the 2009 havraa agreement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc it added its signature, or told the chief labour-relations officer in writing that it wants to be a party (the form annexed)

-- (ב), the definition: "מעסיק ציבורי" is one of four.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_4
GIVEN e IS A `havraa agreement employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed by a public employer in the 2009 sense` e IF
        `is a budgeted body` (e's `the employing body`)
    OR e's `employed by a health corporation`
    OR `is a supported body` (e's `the employing body`)
    OR e's `employed by a funded education institution`

-- (א): every employee of a signing employer whose pay is computed by the
-- agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents; (ב): the same employees,
-- of another public employer that joins.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN e IS A `havraa agreement employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2009 havraa agreement applies to` e IF
        e's `paid by agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents`
    AND (    e's `employed by an employer that signed the 2009 havraa agreement`
         OR (    `employed by a public employer in the 2009 sense` e
             AND e's `the employer joined the 2009 havraa agreement`))

`a municipal clerk of a local authority that did not sign but joined` MEANS
    `havraa agreement employee` WITH
        `employed by an employer that signed the 2009 havraa agreement` IS FALSE
        `paid by agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents` IS TRUE
        `the employing body` IS `a local authority`
        `employed by a health corporation` IS FALSE
        `employed by a funded education institution` IS FALSE
        `the employer joined the 2009 havraa agreement` IS TRUE

`a municipal clerk of a local authority that neither signed nor joined` MEANS
    `havraa agreement employee` WITH
        `employed by an employer that signed the 2009 havraa agreement` IS FALSE
        `paid by agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents` IS TRUE
        `the employing body` IS `a local authority`
        `employed by a health corporation` IS FALSE
        `employed by a funded education institution` IS FALSE
        `the employer joined the 2009 havraa agreement` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the 2009 havraa agreement applies to` `a municipal clerk of a local authority that did not sign but joined`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2009 havraa agreement applies to` `a municipal clerk of a local authority that neither signed nor joined`

§§ `3 הסכם לתקופה מסוימת`

-- akn:art_3/p3 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:art_3/p4 A fax banner; no rule.

-- From the day it was signed to 31 December 2010; nothing in it, §4
-- included, renews itself when the period ends.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 2009 havraa agreement's period` d IF
        d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 16 6 2009)
    AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2010)

`the 2009 havraa agreement renews itself` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT `in the 2009 havraa agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2010)
#ASSERT NOT `in the 2009 havraa agreement's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011)

§§ `4 הפחתת סכום דמי הבראה`

-- 4.1, second paragraph: "דמי הבראה" is havraa pay, a recreation allowance,
-- or any like payment under another name.
@desc A payment, as far as §4.1's definition of havraa pay asks.
DECLARE `payment called recreation` IS ONE OF
    `havraa pay`
    `a recreation allowance`
    `a like payment under another name`
    `a payment of another kind`

@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1/p2
GIVEN p IS A `payment called recreation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is havraa pay in the 2009 sense` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `a payment of another kind`

-- 4.1 and 4.2: the havraa day's price, by which the havraa pay of 2009 and
-- of 2010 is computed, is halved, and the pay with it; but the reduction is
-- never more than the reduction of the State's employees' havraa day, which
-- the statute sets (an input, set elsewhere).
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_4-1 akn:art_4__para_4-2
GIVEN `the havraa day's price` IS A NUMBER
      `the State employees' reduction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduced havraa day price` `the havraa day's price` `the State employees' reduction` IS
    `the havraa day's price` MINUS min (50% TIMES `the havraa day's price`) `the State employees' reduction`

`why the State employees' reduction is an input` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "החוק לתשלום חלקי של דמי הבראה בשירות הציבורי בשנים 2009 ו-2010 (הוראת שעה), התשס\"ט-2009"

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2009 agreement halves the havraa day of` y IF
    y EQUALS 2009 OR y EQUALS 2010

#ASSERT `the reduced havraa day price` 400 150 EQUALS 250
#ASSERT `the reduced havraa day price` 400 250 EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `the 2009 agreement halves the havraa day of` 2010
#ASSERT NOT `the 2009 agreement halves the havraa day of` 2011

-- 4.3: where 4.1 could not be applied in full because 2009's havraa pay was
-- already paid, in place of 4.1 and 4.2 no havraa pay is paid in 2010; but
-- where the workplace's havraa day is dearer than the State employees', the
-- pay is paid at the workplace's price less the State employees' price.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-3 akn:art_4__para_4-3/p2
GIVEN `the workplace's havraa day price` IS A NUMBER
      `the State employees' havraa day price` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa day price where 2009's was already paid` `the workplace's havraa day price` `the State employees' havraa day price` IS
    IF `the workplace's havraa day price` `is above` `the State employees' havraa day price`
    THEN `the workplace's havraa day price` MINUS `the State employees' havraa day price`
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the havraa day price where 2009's was already paid` 450 400 EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `the havraa day price where 2009's was already paid` 400 400 EQUALS 0

-- 4.4: where havraa pay is a separate component paid other than once a
-- year, 4.1-4.3 do not apply and the reduction falls in 2010, by how much
-- of 2009 the employee worked for the employer: (א)(1) all of it, nothing
-- in 2010; (א)(2) part of it, nothing for a first stretch of 2010 as long
-- as the time worked in 2009, then half to the end of 2010; (ב) none of it
-- (one who started in 2010), half throughout 2010. The share is of the
-- component a day of 2010 earns; the time worked in 2009 is counted in days.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-4 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_a akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_a__cls_1 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_a__cls_2 akn:art_4__para_4-4__subpara_b
GIVEN `days worked for the employer in 2009` IS A NUMBER
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of the havraa component paid for a day of 2010` `days worked for the employer in 2009` d IS
    BRANCH IF `days worked for the employer in 2009` AT LEAST 365 THEN 0
           IF `days worked for the employer in 2009` GREATER THAN 0
              AND DATE_SERIAL d LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2010) PLUS `days worked for the employer in 2009`
              THEN 0
           OTHERWISE 50%

#ASSERT `the share of the havraa component paid for a day of 2010` 365 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2010) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the share of the havraa component paid for a day of 2010` 181 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2010) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the share of the havraa component paid for a day of 2010` 181 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2010) EQUALS 50%
#ASSERT `the share of the havraa component paid for a day of 2010` 0 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2010) EQUALS 50%

DECLARE `havraa agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `discuss how havraa pay included in the regular pay is reduced`
    `pay the reduced part for the time after retirement or death`
    `follow and help carry out the 2009 havraa agreement and decide its disputes`

-- 4.5: employees whose havraa pay is part of their regular pay, not a
-- separate component: how it is reduced is for the follow-up committee.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-5
`reducing havraa pay included in the regular pay` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `discuss how havraa pay included in the regular pay is reduced`

-- 4.6(א): an employee or former employee paid havraa once a year, who
-- retires or dies within a havraa year and is owed havraa pay also for the
-- part after it, has the reduction only on the part before it. A havraa
-- year is a year for which havraa pay falls due between the agreement's
-- entry into force and 31.12.2010.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_a/p2 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_a/p3 A fax banner; no rule.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-6 akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_a akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_a/p4
GIVEN `the year's havraa pay unreduced` IS A NUMBER
      `the year's havraa pay reduced` IS A NUMBER
      `share of the havraa year before retirement or death` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa pay of the year of retirement or death` `the year's havraa pay unreduced` `the year's havraa pay reduced` `share of the havraa year before retirement or death` IS
        `share of the havraa year before retirement or death` TIMES `the year's havraa pay reduced`
    PLUS (1 MINUS `share of the havraa year before retirement or death`) TIMES `the year's havraa pay unreduced`

GIVEN `the date its havraa pay falls due` IS A DATE
      `the agreement came into force` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a havraa year in the 2009 sense` `the date its havraa pay falls due` `the agreement came into force` IF
        `the date its havraa pay falls due` `is on or after` `the agreement came into force`
    AND `the date its havraa pay falls due` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2010)

#ASSERT `the havraa pay of the year of retirement or death` 2000 1000 0.25 EQUALS 1750

-- 4.6(ב): where the retirement or death came after the year's havraa pay
-- was paid (reduced), the employer pays the one entitled the part reduced
-- for the time after it, within 60 days of the retirement or death.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-6__subpara_b
GIVEN `the year's havraa pay unreduced` IS A NUMBER
      `the year's havraa pay reduced` IS A NUMBER
      `share of the havraa year after retirement or death` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduced part owed after retirement or death` `the year's havraa pay unreduced` `the year's havraa pay reduced` `share of the havraa year after retirement or death` IS
    `share of the havraa year after retirement or death` TIMES (`the year's havraa pay unreduced` MINUS `the year's havraa pay reduced`)

`paying back the reduction after retirement or death` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the reduced part for the time after retirement or death`
    WITHIN 60

#ASSERT `the reduced part owed after retirement or death` 2000 1000 0.75 EQUALS 750

-- 4.7: the reduction does not touch budgetary pension payments, the havraa
-- allowance in them included; one owed havraa pay in 2009 or 2010 for a year
-- partly active and partly pensioned falls under 4.6.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-7 akn:art_4__para_4-7/p2
`the reduction touches budgetary pensions` MEANS FALSE

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a year partly active and partly pensioned falls under 4.6 in` y IF
    y EQUALS 2009 OR y EQUALS 2010

-- 4.8 and 4.9: for what is paid to a provident fund for the employee (a
-- provident fund as the Financial Services (Provident Funds) Law defines
-- it), and for a one-time payment on leaving work, the havraa pay counts as
-- if it had not been reduced. 4.10: nothing else of the rules on havraa pay
-- changes.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-8 akn:art_4__para_4-8/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-9 akn:art_4__para_4-10
GIVEN `the havraa pay unreduced` IS A NUMBER
      `the havraa pay reduced` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa pay counted for provident funds and severance` `the havraa pay unreduced` `the havraa pay reduced` IS
    `the havraa pay unreduced`

`the 2009 agreement changes other havraa rules` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT `the havraa pay counted for provident funds and severance` 2000 1000 EQUALS 2000

§§ `5 עובדים בדירוג הרנטגנאים`

-- §4 applies to radiographers, save that the reduction does not reach the
-- five added havraa days the civil-service regulations (תקשי"ר §28.241(ד))
-- give them: in the State's service, and with other employers in health
-- work places that apply that rule as it stands. Naming the regulations
-- changes nothing of their standing.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5__para_5-1 akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_a akn:art_5__para_5-1__subpara_b akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN `employed by the State` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a health work place that applies §28.241(ד) as it stands` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a radiographer's five added days are not reduced` `employed by the State` `a health work place that applies §28.241(ד) as it stands` IF
    `employed by the State` OR `a health work place that applies §28.241(ד) as it stands`

`a radiographer's added havraa days` MEANS 5

`naming the regulations changes their standing` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `a radiographer's five added days are not reduced` FALSE FALSE

§§ `6 תחולה`

-- The agreement comes into force once the legislation of the havraa statute
-- is complete: the day it does is an input (the statute is outside the
-- corpus).
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1
GIVEN `the havraa statute's legislation was completed` IS A DATE
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2009 havraa agreement is in force on` `the havraa statute's legislation was completed` d IF
        d `is on or after` `the havraa statute's legislation was completed`
    AND `in the 2009 havraa agreement's period` d

`why the statute's enactment is an input` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "החוק לתשלום חלקי של דמי הבראה בשירות הציבורי בשנים 2009 ו-2010 (הוראת שעה), התשס\"ט-2009"

§§ `7 הסכמים קודמים`

-- akn:art_7/p2 A fax banner; no rule.
-- akn:art_7/p3 A fax banner; no rule.

@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7/p1
`earlier terms stand unless the 2009 havraa agreement changes them` MEANS TRUE

§§ `8 הכרעה בחילוקי דעות`

-- A follow-up committee of the wages commissioner and the Histadrut's
-- chairman follows and helps carry out the agreement and decides its
-- disputes, finally; it may decide them also for an employer or public
-- employer that is not a party to the framework agreement of 17.4.08 or
-- has not acted by it.
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p1 akn:art_8/p2 akn:art_8/p3
`following the 2009 havraa agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `follow and help carry out the 2009 havraa agreement and decide its disputes`

`the follow-up committee's decisions are final` MEANS TRUE

`the committee may decide for an employer outside the framework agreement of 17.4.08` MEANS TRUE

§§ `חתימות ונספח`

-- akn:conclusions The signing formula, the signatures and the employers' captions, stamps and fax banners on the signature pages; no rule.
-- akn:attachments The annexes: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1 The joining notice (§2(ב)): its addressee, its blank fields, its copies and fax banners; no rule beyond §2(ב)'s.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1 The corpus's note on the statute's printed copy enclosed with the circular, and the handwriting on its last page; no rule.
